# Assimilate the Wounded's "that was put there from the battlefield this turn" (CR 400.7): Bot2's Grizzly Bears died to Terror
# on turn 4 and stays in its graveyard, while Bot3's Grizzly Bears dies to the second Terror on turn 7, the turn Bot1 casts
# Assimilate the Wounded. Only Bot3's slot has a legal card, so only that card is assimilated (as a 3/3 Borg artifact creature):
# the older card in Bot2's graveyard is refused by the turn the card arrived there.

